## 🏷️ Front Matter & Automation

All documentation, configuration, and pattern files in this repository should include a front matter block (YAML or JSON) at the top with key metadata and mustache placeholders.  
**Examples of recommended front matter fields:**

```yaml
---
title: "{{title}}"
description: "{{description}}"
version: "{{version}}"
last_updated: "{{last_updated}}"
author: "{{author}}"
slug: "{{slug}}"
namespace: "{{theme_namespace}}"
textdomain: "{{textdomain}}"
license: "{{license}}"
type: "{{type}}"
tags: ["block-theme", "wordpress", "copilot", "automation"]
