---
```

- For all Copilot automation, ensure `copilot_ready: true` and `copilot_frontmatter: true` are included.
- For pattern, template, or part files, include a block-level front matter or header for Copilot to parse.
- Document all new front matter fields in [placeholder-schema-and-usage.md](./placeholder-schema-and-usage.md).

